{"id":"ca89eef53dcad278","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-stein-manifold.md","title":"Stein Manifold","display":"df-stein-manifold — Stein Manifold","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-stein-manifold","aliases":["58-df-stein-manifold"],"display":"df-stein-manifold — Stein Manifold","depends_on":["[[../batch15/58-df-complex-manifold.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-compact.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-complex-structure.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-stein-manifold"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-stein-manifold</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-stein-manifold — Stein Manifold"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0ab38aca0c5161bb\" href=\"?note=0ab38aca0c5161bb\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-complex-manifold.md\">../batch15/58-df-complex-manifold.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"050f6d05b2c94aea\" href=\"?note=050f6d05b2c94aea\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-compact.md\">../batch05/58-df-compact.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9edade6bb0a410c1\" href=\"?note=9edade6bb0a410c1\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-complex-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-complex-structure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,n\\in V\">\\(X,n\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComplexManifold}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ComplexManifold}_S\\)</span> (complex-manifold predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0ab38aca0c5161bb\" href=\"?note=0ab38aca0c5161bb\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-complex-manifold.md\">../batch15/58-df-complex-manifold.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComplexStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ComplexStructure}_S\\)</span> (maximal complex-atlas predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9edade6bb0a410c1\" href=\"?note=9edade6bb0a410c1\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-complex-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-complex-structure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HolomorphicFunction}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{HolomorphicFunction}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O(X,\\mathcal A,n)\">\\(\\mathcal O(X,\\mathcal A,n)\\)</span> (defined below from a complex atlas)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compact}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\)</span> (compactness predicate for the designated subspace topology; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"050f6d05b2c94aea\" href=\"?note=050f6d05b2c94aea\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-compact.md\">../batch05/58-df-compact.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Stein}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Stein}_S\\)</span> (Stein-manifold predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}holomorphic\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{HolomorphicFunction}_S(f,X,\\mathcal A,n)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,\\mathbb C)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\langle U,V,\\phi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\forall z\\in V\\;\n\\exists L\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb C^n}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall u,v\\in\\mathbb C^n\\;\\forall a\\in\\mathbb C\\;\nL(au+v)=aL(u)+L(v)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{35mm}\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall h\\in\\mathbb C^n\\;\\Bigl(\n0&lt;\\|h\\|&lt;\\delta\\land z+h\\in V\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{55mm}\\to\n|(f\\circ\\phi^{-1})(z+h)-(f\\circ\\phi^{-1})(z)-L(h)|\n\\leq\\varepsilon\\|h\\|\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}holomorphic\\text{-}function}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{HolomorphicFunction}_S(f,X,\\mathcal A,n)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,\\mathbb C)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall\\langle U,V,\\phi\\rangle\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\forall z\\in V\\;\n\\exists L\\in\\mathbb C^{\\mathbb C^n}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall u,v\\in\\mathbb C^n\\;\\forall a\\in\\mathbb C\\;\nL(au+v)=aL(u)+L(v)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{35mm}\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\delta\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall h\\in\\mathbb C^n\\;\\Bigl(\n0&lt;\\|h\\|&lt;\\delta\\land z+h\\in V\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{55mm}\\to\n|(f\\circ\\phi^{-1})(z+h)-(f\\circ\\phi^{-1})(z)-L(h)|\n\\leq\\varepsilon\\|h\\|\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stein\\text{-}holomorphic\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathcal O(X,\\mathcal A,n)\n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathbb C^X\\mid\\operatorname{HolomorphicFunction}_S(f,X,\\mathcal A,n)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stein\\text{-}holomorphic\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\mathcal O(X,\\mathcal A,n)\n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathbb C^X\\mid\\operatorname{HolomorphicFunction}_S(f,X,\\mathcal A,n)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stein\\text{-}manifold}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Stein}_S(X,n)\n\\leftrightarrow\nn\\in\\omega\\land\\exists\\tau,\\mathcal A\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ComplexManifold}_S(X,\\tau,n)\n\\land\\mathrm{ComplexStructure}_S(\\mathcal A,X,\\tau,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall K\\subseteq X\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Compact}_S(K,\\{U\\cap K\\mid U\\in\\tau\\})\n\\to\\exists H_K\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\Bigl[(K=\\varnothing\\land H_K=\\varnothing)\\lor\n\\Bigl(K\\neq\\varnothing\\land\nH_K=\\left\\{z\\in X\\,\\middle|\\,\\forall f\\in\\mathcal O(X,\\mathcal A,n)\\;|f(z)|\\leq\\sup_{w\\in K}|f(w)|\\right\\}\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\n\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\!\\left(H_K,\\{U\\cap H_K\\mid U\\in\\tau\\}\\right)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\Bigl(\nx\\neq y\\to\\exists f\\in\\mathcal O(X,\\mathcal A,n)\\;(f(x)\\neq f(y))\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr),\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stein\\text{-}manifold}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Stein}_S(X,n)\n\\leftrightarrow\nn\\in\\omega\\land\\exists\\tau,\\mathcal A\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ComplexManifold}_S(X,\\tau,n)\n\\land\\mathrm{ComplexStructure}_S(\\mathcal A,X,\\tau,n)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall K\\subseteq X\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Compact}_S(K,\\{U\\cap K\\mid U\\in\\tau\\})\n\\to\\exists H_K\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\Bigl[(K=\\varnothing\\land H_K=\\varnothing)\\lor\n\\Bigl(K\\neq\\varnothing\\land\nH_K=\\left\\{z\\in X\\,\\middle|\\,\\forall f\\in\\mathcal O(X,\\mathcal A,n)\\;|f(z)|\\leq\\sup_{w\\in K}|f(w)|\\right\\}\\Bigr)\\Bigr]\n\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\!\\left(H_K,\\{U\\cap H_K\\mid U\\in\\tau\\}\\right)\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\Bigl(\nx\\neq y\\to\\exists f\\in\\mathcal O(X,\\mathcal A,n)\\;(f(x)\\neq f(y))\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr),\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The set of holomorphic functions is generated from chartwise complex Fréchet derivatives, compactness is evaluated in explicit subspace topologies, and the empty compact set is assigned the empty holomorphic hull without invoking an undefined empty supremum.</li>\n<li>Stein manifolds are precisely those admitting proper holomorphic embeddings into <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{C}^N\">\\(\\mathbb{C}^N\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Examples include <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{C}^n\">\\(\\mathbb{C}^n\\)</span> and pseudoconvex domains in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{C}^n\">\\(\\mathbb{C}^n\\)</span>; boundedness alone is not the defining condition.</li>\n<li>Cartan's Theorem A and B hold on Stein manifolds.</li>\n<li>The Oka–Grauert principle compares holomorphic and topological classifications of principal bundles; it does not assert that every such bundle is trivial.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-complex-manifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"0ab38aca0c5161bb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-complex-manifold.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-compact.md","status":"resolved","id":"050f6d05b2c94aea","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-compact.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-complex-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"9edade6bb0a410c1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-complex-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"re